<title>TAIWAN: China Steel says July-Dec profit falls.</title>
<headline>China Steel says July-Dec profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>July-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				41,577   vs    43,380</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 7,938   vs    10,351</p>
<p>NOTE - China Steel Corp is Taiwan's largest steel maker. The company, previously state-run, was privatised in April 1995.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
